### Clerk

<img width="1722" alt="image" src="https://github.com/lobehub/lobe-chat/assets/28616219/2581b30b-93f1-4ce4-9551-cbc262dd27e2">


[Clerk](https://clerk.com) 应该是近期开始火起来的 Auth 解决方案平台。我之前推上关注的一个设计师专门 show 过他给 clerk 做的方案，当时看过很惊艳。也有不少开发者有在推特上推荐了。看了下[文档](https://clerk.com/docs/quickstarts/nextjs)，基本上和 `next-auth` 非常接近：

```tsx
import { ClerkProvider } from '@clerk/nextjs'
import './globals.css'
 
export default function RootLayout({
  children,
}: {
  children: React.ReactNode
}) {
  return (
    <ClerkProvider>
      <html lang="en">
        <body>{children}</body>
      </html>
    </ClerkProvider>
  )
}
```

```ts
import { authMiddleware } from "@clerk/nextjs";
 
// See https://clerk.com/docs/references/nextjs/auth-middleware
// for more information about configuring your Middleware
export default authMiddleware({
  // Allow signed out users to access the specified routes:
  // publicRoutes: ['/anyone-can-visit-this-route'],
});
 
export const config = {
  matcher: [
    // Exclude files with a "." followed by an extension, which are typically static files.
    // Exclude files in the _next directory, which are Next.js internals.
    "/((?!.+\\.[\\w]+$|_next).*)",
    // Re-include any files in the api or trpc folders that might have an extension
    "/(api|trpc)(.*)"
  ]
};
```

套一个 provider、加一个中间件就能完成整个 auth 逻辑，上手很简单。同时整个设计风格就是之前推特上看到的那样，简约、现代。

