# RFC 异步任务架构设计

## Motivation

### 当前异步任务架构

目前项目中大多数是阻塞式的请求：指的是 trpc endpoint 或者就普通的 next route handler 中接受到请求后，直到任务处理完才 response。

但是非阻塞的异步任务（或者说 background 任务）也慢慢变多，例如已经存在的文件分块和向量化接口。

以文件分块接口为例，在 `src/server/routers/lambda/chunk.ts` 中定义了触发文件分块的异步任务的接口：

```typescript
export const chunkRouter = router({
  createParseFileTask: chunkProcedure
    .input(
      z.object({
        id: z.string(),
        skipExist: z.boolean().optional(),
      }),
    )
    .mutation(async ({ ctx, input }) => {
      const asyncTaskId = await ctx.chunkService.asyncParseFileToChunks(
        input.id,
        ctx.jwtPayload,
        input.skipExist,
      );

      return { id: asyncTaskId, success: true };
    }),
})
```

而在 `src/server/services/chunk/index.ts` 中，`asyncParseFileToChunks` 其实是调用了另一个 trpc 路由 `asyncCaller.file.parseFileToChunks.mutate`：

```typescript
export class ChunkService {
    /**
   * parse file to chunks with async task
   */
  async asyncParseFileToChunks(fileId: string, payload: JWTPayload, skipExist?: boolean) {
    const result = await this.fileModel.findById(fileId);

    if (!result) return;

    // skip if already exist chunk tasks
    if (skipExist && result.chunkTaskId) return;

    // 1. create a asyncTaskId
    const asyncTaskId = await this.asyncTaskModel.create({
      status: AsyncTaskStatus.Processing,
      type: AsyncTaskType.Chunking,
    });

    await this.fileModel.update(fileId, { chunkTaskId: asyncTaskId });

    const asyncCaller = await createAsyncServerClient(this.userId, payload);

    // trigger parse file task asynchronously
    asyncCaller.file.parseFileToChunks
      .mutate({ fileId: fileId, taskId: asyncTaskId })
      .catch(async (e) => {
        console.error('[ParseFileToChunks] error:', e);

        await this.asyncTaskModel.update(asyncTaskId, {
          error: new AsyncTaskError(
            AsyncTaskErrorType.TaskTriggerError,
            'trigger chunk embedding async task error. Please make sure the APP_URL is available from your server. You can check the proxy config or WAF blocking',
          ),
          status: AsyncTaskStatus.Error,
        });
      });

    return asyncTaskId;
  }
}
```

可以看到我们没有对 `asyncCaller.file.parseFileToChunks.mutate` 进行 await。

调用 `asyncCaller.file.parseFileToChunks.mutate` 其实就是向 nextjs 请求了另一个接口。

而这个接口 `src/server/routers/async/file.ts` 中，`parseFileToChunks` 则是一个阻塞式的接口。

```typescript
export const fileRouter = router({
  parseFileToChunks: fileProcedure
    .input(
      z.object({
        fileId: z.string(),
        taskId: z.string(),
      }),
    )
    .mutation(async ({ ctx, input }) => {
      const asyncTask = await ctx.asyncTaskModel.findById(input.taskId);

      if (!asyncTask) throw new TRPCError({ code: 'BAD_REQUEST', message: 'Async Task not found' });

      try {
        const startAt = Date.now();

        const timeoutPromise = new Promise((_, reject) => {
          setTimeout(() => {
            reject(
              new AsyncTaskError(
                AsyncTaskErrorType.Timeout,
                'chunking task is timeout, please try again',
              ),
            );
          }, ASYNC_TASK_TIMEOUT);
        });

        const chunkingPromise = async () => {
          const chunkService = ctx.chunkService;
          // update the task status to processing
          await ctx.asyncTaskModel.update(input.taskId, { status: AsyncTaskStatus.Processing });
          // ... do chunking
          return { success: true };
        };
        // Race between the chunking process and the timeout
        return await Promise.race([chunkingPromise(), timeoutPromise]);
      } catch (e) {
        const error = e as any;

        const asyncTaskError = error.body
          ? ({ body: safeParseJSON(error.body) ?? error.body, name: error.name } as IAsyncTaskError)
          : new AsyncTaskError((error as Error).name, error.message);

        console.error('[Chunking Error]', asyncTaskError);
        await ctx.asyncTaskModel.update(input.taskId, {
          error: asyncTaskError,
          status: AsyncTaskStatus.Error,
        });

        return {
          message: `File ${file.name}(${input.taskId}) failed to chunking: ${(e as Error).message}`,
          success: false,
        };
      }
    }),
});

```

`createAsyncServerClient` 其实创建另一个 trpc client 专门处理异步路由， 请求 next server 的路径是 `/trpc/async/[trpc]`：

```typescript
import type { AsyncRouter } from './index';

export const createAsyncServerClient = async (userId: string, payload: JWTPayload) => {
  const gateKeeper = await KeyVaultsGateKeeper.initWithEnvKey();
  const headers: Record<string, string> = {
    Authorization: `Bearer ${serverDBEnv.KEY_VAULTS_SECRET}`,
    [LOBE_CHAT_AUTH_HEADER]: await gateKeeper.encrypt(JSON.stringify({ payload, userId })),
  };

  if (process.env.VERCEL_AUTOMATION_BYPASS_SECRET) {
    headers['x-vercel-protection-bypass'] = process.env.VERCEL_AUTOMATION_BYPASS_SECRET;
  }

  return createTRPCClient<AsyncRouter>({
    links: [
      httpBatchLink({
        headers,
        transformer: superjson,
        url: urlJoin(appEnv.APP_URL!, '/trpc/async'),
      }),
    ],
  });
};
```

文件夹 `src/server/routers/async` 中目前定义了像 `file`、`ragEval` 等异步任务。这些实现本身都是阻塞的，但是触发这些路由本身的那些接口是非阻塞的。

总结目前的异步任务架构：

- 采用双路由实现
  - 一个 trigger 路由，一般放在文件夹 `src/server/routers/lambda`
  - 一个 用于执行异步任务的 runner 路由，一般放在文件夹 `src/server/routers/async`
- trigger 路由调用 runner 路由，但是不 await
  - 调用 runner 路由时透传 asyncTaskId
  - 返回 asyncTaskId
- 按照目前的实现，asyncTask 做大执行时长也是 async 路由环境的最大请求响应时长，例如 vercel node runtime：60s，具体查看： <https://vercel.com/docs/functions/limitations#max-duration>

### 问题

- asyncTask 目前使用 node runtime 在 vercel 上运行，runner 最大执行时长是 60s
- 每个 asyncTask 都需要手动管理 asyncTask 的创建，状态管理，错误处理，asyncTaskId 传递，这些每个异步任务的都会经历的相同的流程
- 如果需求变化到需要控制单个异步任务的超时限制，异步任务执行完调用 webhook 等扩展性需求

### 解决方案

对于后两个问题，打算引入一个异步任务框架，来规范化统一管理异步任务。

开源社区有个异步任务框架：[trigger.dev](https://trigger.dev/)。

它的核心使用流程这里简化描述：

1. 定义 asyncTask

```typescript
import { task } from '@trigger.dev/sdk/v3';

export const asyncTask = task({
    id: 'file-chunking',
    // 框架层面管理超时
    maxDuration: 60 * 10,
    retry: {
        // !: Don't retry, or may cost money multiple times
        maxAttempts: 0,
    },
    init: async (payload: InferencePayload, { ctx }) => {
        return {
            a: 'aaa'
            b: payload.b,
        };
    },
    run: async (payload: InferencePayload, { init }) => {
        return {
            a: init.a
        };
    },
    onSuccess: async () => {
      console.log('success');
    },
    onError: async () => {
      console.log('error');
    },
});
```

2. 调用 asyncTask

```typescript
import {asyncTask} from './asyncTask';

const { id: asyncTaskId } = await asyncTask.trigger({
    payload: {
        b: 'bbb'
    }
});
```

可以看出 trigger.dev 框架层面管理了 asyncTaskId，超时，错误处理等。

## 提案

```typescript

interface AsyncTaskConfig<P> {
    name: string;
    maxDuration: number;
    retry: {
        maxAttempts: number;
    };
    run: (payload: P) => Promise<any>;
    onSuccess: () => Promise<void>;
    onError: () => Promise<void>;
}

type RunHandle = { asyncTaskId: string }
type AsyncTask<P> = {
  trigger: (payload: P) => Promise<RunHandle>;
};

interface AsyncTaskManager {
  register:<P> (taskConfig: AsyncTaskConfig<P>) => AsyncTask;
}
```

### Trigger.dev 实现

```typescript
import { task } from '@trigger.dev/sdk/v3';

export class TriggerDevAsyncTaskManager implements AsyncTaskManager {
    register<P>(taskConfig: AsyncTaskConfig<P>) {
      const asyncTask =  task({
            id: taskConfig.name,
            maxDuration: taskConfig.maxDuration,
            retry: taskConfig.retry,
            run: taskConfig.run,
            onSuccess: taskConfig.onSuccess,
            onError: taskConfig.onError,
        });

      return async function (payload: P) {
        const { id: asyncTaskId } = await asyncTask.trigger({
            payload: {
                b: 'bbb'
            }
        });
        return { asyncTaskId };
      }
    }
}
```

### Nextjs 实现

// 待我再思考优化下，目前是拍脑袋写的

```typescript
export class NextjsAsyncTaskManager implements AsyncTaskManager {
    taskMap: Map<string, AsyncTaskConfig<any>> = new Map();
  
    register<P>(taskConfig: AsyncTaskConfig<P>) {
      this.taskMap.set(taskConfig.name, taskConfig);
      return async function (payload: P) {
        const {id: asyncTaskId } = await asyncTaskModel.createAsyncTask();
        const asyncCaller = await createAsyncServerClient(this.userId, payload);
        asyncCaller.runAsyncTask({
          taskName: taskConfig.name,
          asyncTaskId,
          payload
        })
        return { asyncTaskId };
      }
    }
}

// 需要注册 runAsyncTask 路由
const asyncTaskRouter = router({ 
  runAsyncTask: asyncAuthedProcedure
    .input(
      z.object({
        taskName: z.string(),
        asyncTaskId: z.string(),
        payload: z.any(),
      }),
    )
    .mutation(async ({ ctx, input }) => {
      const asyncTask = await ctx.asyncTaskModel.findById(input.asyncTaskId);
      if (!asyncTask) throw new TRPCError({ code: 'BAD_REQUEST', message: 'Async Task not found' });
      try {
        const result = await this.taskMap.get(input.taskName)?.run(input.payload);
        await ctx.asyncTaskModel.update(input.asyncTaskId, { status: AsyncTaskStatus.Success });
        return { result };
      } catch (e) {
        await ctx.asyncTaskModel.update(input.asyncTaskId, { status: AsyncTaskStatus.Error });
        throw e;
      }
    }),
}
```

